::ingredients

(red onion) as needed
(vinegar) equal volume to water
(water) equal volume to vinegar
(salt) to taste
(pickling herbs or spices, optional) to taste

::equipment

(jar)
(pot)

::instructions

(red onion) <halve> <slice, root to stem> <place, jar>
(water) + (vinegar) <combine, equal parts, pot>
    + (salt) <bring to boil>
    <remove from heat, as soon as boiling>
